{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmodrill is a 2D open world space adventure in which you drill through planets to gather valuable resources. Explore the galaxy, unveil its secrets and take on powerful enemies as you charter a path into the unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to upgrade your drill, unlocking new abilities and allowing you to dig deeper, travel farther, and face increasingly powerful foes. Along the way, you\u2019ll discover space stations\u2014once beacons of hope, now overrun by ruthless pirates. Liberate these outposts to rest, refuel, and push your mission forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one knows exactly what the pirates are after... but one thing is certain: you\u2019re the only one with the power to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.poster.webp?t=1751453543\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.webp?t=1751453543\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the universe of Cosmodrill on your own terms. Where you go is entirely up to you. In the open world of Cosmodrill, there are no questmarkers telling you where to go next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drill through entire planets in search of resources and uncover the secrets hidden deep within them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use resources to upgrade your ship. Fly farther, drill deeper, and survive longer to push further into the unknown than ever before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your drill to defeat enemies, activate special abilities to triumph in battle, and liberate the space stations occupied by pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/452be6ee4ea2b712a19d45f1cf6b7c28.poster.webp?t=1751453543\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/452be6ee4ea2b712a19d45f1cf6b7c28.webp?t=1751453543\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722660?t=1751453543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/db9cd754dde441791a2ad67d762b0cc49c214526/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751453543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/6fa1654a0104584ca107988efc9b56f6040f70b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751453543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/6fa1654a0104584ca107988efc9b56f6040f70b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751453543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmodrill is a 2D open world space adventure in which you drill through planets to gather valuable resources. Explore the galaxy, unveil its secrets and take on powerful enemies as you charter a path into the unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to upgrade your drill, unlocking new abilities and allowing you to dig deeper, travel farther, and face increasingly powerful foes. Along the way, you\u2019ll discover space stations\u2014once beacons of hope, now overrun by ruthless pirates. Liberate these outposts to rest, refuel, and push your mission forward.</p><p cl